## Workspace map (Windows workstation)

| What | Where | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| SAM2 trainer (consumes exported training sets) | `D:\src\git\Sam2Trainer` | Has own `CLAUDE.md` and `.cursor/rules/`; read them before editing there |
| Older trainer copy | `D:\src\git\VikingSlackUsersAI\Sam2SegmentationTrainer` | Confirm with the user which trainer a task means |
| Viking (viewer, OData/gRPC servers, Identity) | `D:\src\git\Viking` | Has own `CLAUDE.md` and `.cursor/rules/` (incl. `coordinate-spaces.mdc`, `odata-conventions.mdc`) |
| connectomes.pitt.edu deploy repo | `D:\src\git\connectomes-deploy` | `deploy-connectomes` skill |
| Improvement-loop reports | `D:\src\git\Nornir Automatic Improvement Reports` | `nornir-improve-loop` output root |
| Volumes (real data) | `Y:\Volumes` (e.g. `RC2`, `SmallMouse`) | NAS-backed; read-only for tests; copy small sections into test data |
| Exported training sets | `Y:\SAM2TrainingData` | Naming: `Training-set-naming` rule |
| NAS share | `\\192.168.0.199\Data` | |
| Unit test data | `TESTINPUTPATH` = `D:\nornir-testdata` (`/nornir-testdata` in the dev container) | `TEST_DATA_SETUP.md` |
| Test output / scratch | `TESTOUTPUTPATH` = `C:\Temp\Nornir` | Never the repo root |
| Docker host layout | `D:\Docker` (`/srv/docker` on Linux) | `docker-machine-layout` skill |
| Python | Windows `venv\pyre314`; dev container `/opt/venv` | `Virtual-Env` rule |

If a path above no longer exists, say so and update this table; do not guess a replacement.

### Live checkouts feed deployments

`rebuild-and-start*.ps1` / `build.ps1` under `D:\Docker\Builds\<service>` build from the **live
checkouts** (`D:\src\git\Viking`, `D:\src\git\Sam2Trainer`, `D:\src\git\nornir\nornir-docker`), so
committing or switching branches there changes what the next rebuild deploys. Ask first when a
deployment may be pending.
